    "text": "\\(f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}{[x]+[-x],} & \\text { when } x \\neq 2 \\\\ \\lambda & \\text { when } x=2\\end{array}\\right.\\)\nIf \\(f(x)\\) is continuous at \\(x=2\\), the value of \\(\\lambda\\) will be"
