  "solution": {
    "text": "Hints: \\(\\mathrm{LHL}=\\operatorname{Lt}_{\\mathrm{h} \\rightarrow 0}[2-\\mathrm{h}]+[-(2-\\mathrm{h})]\\)\n\\(=\\operatorname{Lt}_{\\mathrm{h} \\rightarrow 0} 1+(-2+\\mathrm{h})=1-2=-1\\)\n\\(\\begin{aligned}\n& \\mathrm{RML}=\\underset{\\mathrm{h} \\rightarrow 0}{\\operatorname{Lt}}[2+\\mathrm{h}]+(-(2+\\mathrm{h})) \\\\\n& =2+(-2-\\mathrm{h})=2-3=-1 \\\\\n& \\lambda=-1\n\\end{aligned}\\)"
